Package: rmdal
Title: R Interface to the Mesh Data Abstraction Library (MDAL)
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Michael", "Sumner", , "mdsumner@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2471-7511"),
    person("Lutra Consulting", 
           role = "cph",
           comment = "MDAL library copyright holder")
    )
Description: Provides bindings to the MDAL (Mesh Data Abstraction Library) for 
    reading and writing unstructured mesh data. MDAL supports numerous formats 
    used in hydrology, meteorology, and numerical modelling including 2DM, 
    UGRID, NetCDF, GRIB, XMDF, Selafin, HEC-RAS, FLO-2D, and many others.
    In future meshes may be converted to 'wk' geometry for interoperability with the 
    'sf', 'geos', and 's2' ecosystems, or to 'rgl' mesh3d objects for 3D. 
